<section class="vf-page-hero"><div class="page-width"><span class="eyebrow">Private support</span><h1 class="vf-editorial">Talk to VANTA FORM.</h1><p class="lead">Questions about fit, a future configuration, an order or partnership? Send us what you can. You never need to include intimate photographs to ask for sizing guidance.</p></div></section><section class="vf-page-content"><div class="page-width"><div class="vf-contact">{% form 'contact' %}{% if form.posted_successfully? %}<p class="vf-form-success">Message received. We’ll respond through the contact details you provided.</p>{% endif %}{{ form.errors | default_errors }}<div class="vf-form-grid"><label>Name<input type="text" name="contact[name]" autocomplete="name"></label><label>Email<input type="email" name="contact[email]" autocomplete="email" required></label></div><label>What can we help with?<select name="contact[topic]"><option>Fit & sizing</option><option>Product & availability</option><option>Existing order</option><option>Bespoke</option><option>Retail / partnership</option><option>Other</option></select></label><label>Message<textarea name="contact[body]" rows="7" required></textarea></label><button class="btn" type="submit">Send privately →</button>{% endform %}<aside><span class="eyebrow">Before you send</span><h2>Fit questions are welcome.</h2><p>Measurements in text are enough for initial guidance. Do not send identity documents, payment-card details or unnecessary sensitive information.</p><a href="/pages/fit-guide">Read the Fit Guide →</a></aside></div></div></section>{% schema %}{"name":"Contact","settings":[]}{% endschema %}